1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,800
(Raj:)Oh, but there's money
for a drawer full of Red Vines,

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:05,400
(Raj:)a marshmallow shooting rifle,

3
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:09,040
(Raj:)and a super executive ant farm
with glow-in-the-dark sand?

4
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:12,280
(Sheldon:)Yes.

5
00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:13,950
(Howard:)Okay, what if he
buys his own desk?

6
00:00:13,950 --> 00:00:15,510
(Raj:)Yeah, what
if I buy my own desk?

7
00:00:15,510 --> 00:00:17,180
(Sheldon:)That's ridiculous.
Why?

8
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:19,380
(Katee Sackhoff:)Because...

9
00:00:22,690 --> 00:00:23,920
(Raj:)Yes?

10
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:26,520
(Sheldon:)It's my office.

11
00:00:27,490 --> 00:00:29,190
(Howard(laughs):)Sheldon.
All right, all right.

12
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:31,060
(Sheldon:)He can buy his own desk.

13
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:32,830
(Raj:)And I can put it in your office?

14
00:00:32,830 --> 00:00:34,200
(Sheldon:)Well, you really want

15
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:36,500
(Sheldon:)to dot the I's and cross
the T's, don't you?

16
00:00:37,570 --> 00:00:39,170
(Leonard:)Why would you want
a glow-in-the-dark ant farm?

17
00:00:39,170 --> 00:00:41,910
(Sheldon:)They do some
of their best work at night.

18
00:00:47,780 --> 00:00:49,510
(Penny(picking up a top and sniffing it):)Ah, it's okay.

19
00:00:51,820 --> 00:00:52,780
(Sheldon:)Penny?

20
00:00:52,790 --> 00:01:01,020
(Sheldon:)Penny?

